{"title":"Sandstone","slug":"Sandstone","hero":{"file":"202407052129_imagem_2024-07-05_212922457.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":237,"revid":14315,"timestamp":"2024-08-12T21:27:46Z","lastEditor":"Z3SC","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Stone","value":"$5.5/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$8/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$12/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.0.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"01/14/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"ore","text":"Ore"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Sandstone</b> is one of the many rock nodes that spawn around Oakland. These nodes are found on the sandy shores of the island and the large desert across the bridge.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"ore\">Ore</h2>\n<p>The chart below displays all possible ore that spawn within this node.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sand\">Sand</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sand/\">Sand</a>\n</td>\n<td>Sand spawns <b>exclusively</b> in Sandstone nodes.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"2887e69ba44b044dc4bac098dca7bfdc\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Sandstone_Map-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Sandstone_Map.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location on the Map\">Location on the Map</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location on the Map\">Location on the Map</span></a></div></div><div>Location on the Map</div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>These nodes can spawn in the widest range of sizes out of any of the nodes, with some blocks being tiny, and others spawning as large as marble nodes.</li></ul>"}
